    )
    (property "Note" "On the battery side of the Schottky, so it clamps the start-up feed and never the follower. Pulse 2a: 143 mA for 50 us, 47.5 V worst case. Load dump: 41 mA for 400 ms at the cold VZ minimum, 1.33 W. run_sim boost_converter." (id 8) (at 480.0 542.0 0)
