    )
    (property "Note" "Bank A. 5 mOhm x 18 A x 20 = 1.80 V at the peak, 1.00 V at the 10 A hold -- and headroom to 3.28 V, so a fault up to 32.8 A is MEASURED, not clipped. -> PTC15 (ADC0_SE13)." (id 5) (at 755.0 478.0 0)
      (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide)
    )
    (property "Layout" "IN- is a KELVIN tap at the shunt's ground pad, not a via into the pour" (id 6) (at 755.0 478.0 0)
